{
  "$comment": [
    "THE source of truth for every colour in the app AND the marketing site.",
    "Edit this file, run `npm --prefix site run theme`, and both regenerate.",
    "Never edit the generated files — they carry a DO-NOT-EDIT header and any",
    "hand change is erased on the next run.",
    "",
    "STRUCTURE — the split is the whole point:",
    "",
    "  semantics  Colours that MEAN something: win, loss, breakeven, error.",
    "             Shared by every palette and never rebranded. A trader learns",
    "             that green is profit; if a theme switch could repaint that,",
    "             the colour would stop carrying information. Rebranding must",
    "             be unable to reach these, so they live outside the palettes.",
    "",
    "  palettes   Everything else: brand, neutrals, the AI accent, header.",
    "             This is the part a rebrand is allowed to touch.",
    "",
    "  active     Which palette ships. One word changes the whole product."
  ],
  "active": "pharaoh",
